('mechsanctum-spring-shrimp','fish','태엽새우','투명한 등껍질 안에 태엽과 작은 톱니가 비치는 새우예요.','0.18','0.78','0.024',54,'common','fish/normal/mechsanctum-spring-shrimp_v1_thumbnail.png',54,'fish/normal/mechsanctum-spring-shrimp_v1_sprite.png','mechsanctum','swim',true,'both'),
